      cn: '凌霄閣 428  ·  The Peak',
      lore: 'The wizards built a <span class="accent">cable funicular</span> to climb the mountain. The first to ride it surveyed the harbor for marks of the dark one\'s incursion. Their year of founding is named on every stone of the station. Find it.',
      riddle: 'The funicular has carried wizards up this mountain since the year of its founding. Every sign in the station declares it. Four digits — the year the cable first ran. Speak them.',
      password: '1888',
      ddCongrats: "Higher than any wizard has stood in this city in a hundred years, Miko Takeshi. From Sky Terrace 428 the whole of Hong Kong lies bare — every shadow the dark one tries to hide. The funicular has carried us up this mountain since 1888, and tonight it carried you. Ron is awake now. He hears the wind on the Peak and he is laughing — he always loved high places. The wind itself has just bound to your weapons. A third charge sings in them now. One gate remains.",
      dobbyDirections: 'Master is almost there! Dobby is shaking with excitement! Take the Peak Tram down — back to the city! Then walk to the Star Ferry pier — the green-and-white boats — and cross the great harbor to Tsim Sha Tsui! The old clock tower waits right at the water\'s edge in Kowloon, the final gate! Time grows short, Master!',
      next: 'clock'
    },
    clock: {
      tag: 'THE FOURTH AND FINAL GATE',
